      "id": "claim_c181865b5dad40e786ee778b4d6833b8",
      "statement": "Trusted Actions' Terraform is split into two roots: terraform/global (applied once per AWS account; owns IAM roles/policies, a Secrets Manager secret for OCM/Backplane credentials, and an optional ACM validation CNAME) and terraform/regional (applied once per region; owns VPC, internal ALB, ECS cluster with an EC2 host and EBS volume, task definition/service, a per-region S3 bucket, a CloudWatch-to-Firehose audit pipeline, and a private hosted zone with regional ACM certificate).",
