    {
      "id": "claim_63faebf5e22d470cb3264ab70e30b18f",
      "statement": "Both of Trusted Actions' HCP Terraform workspaces (rosa-trusted-actions-global and rosa-trusted-actions-stage), declared in hcp-terraform/rosa-trusted-actions/main.tf, currently set auto_apply and auto_apply_run_trigger to true, so the regional workspace's source_workspaces = [\"rosa-trusted-actions-global\"] entry resolves to a run trigger that auto-applies after a successful global apply, and the global workspace's remote_state_consumer_workspaces = [\"rosa-trusted-actions-stage\"] grants the regional workspace read access to global's state. Per components/trusted-actions/docs/deployment.md, these auto_apply settings were briefly disabled during the 2026-11 VCS rebind into this monorepo and then restored, and the first post-rebind meta-workspace run auto-applied unexpectedly, so the live HCP settings should be confirmed directly rather than trusting only the committed main.tf.",
      "evidence": [
