      "id": "claim_b825fa370dc34042b1a3873154cf7994",
      "statement": "hcp-terraform/rosa-trusted-actions/main.tf now sets github_repo_org = \"openshift-online\" and github_repo_name = \"rosa-boundary\" for both the rosa-trusted-actions-global and rosa-trusted-actions-stage workspace blocks, with working_directory values of components/trusted-actions/terraform/global and components/trusted-actions/terraform/regional respectively. The workspaces were rebound in place from the archived standalone openshift-online/rosa-trusted-actions repository into this rosa-boundary monorepo as part of the Trusted Actions monorepo migration, without moving their AWS state or re-creating them, so a push that changes components/trusted-actions/terraform/ in this repository is now the live trigger path for these workspaces' plans and applies, superseding any earlier description of them as still bound to the standalone repository.",
